{"path":"container/mdspan/extents/index-cast","title":"std::extents<IndexType,Extents...>::index-cast","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::extents&lt;IndexType,Extents...&gt;::</span><i>index-cast</i>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/mdspan/extents/index-cast","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Casts the index i of type OtherIndexType into a certain integral type.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> OtherIndexType <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">static</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*index-cast*/</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> OtherIndexType<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> i <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark t-mark-expos\">(<span>exposition only*</span>)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Casts the index <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">i</span></code> of type <code>OtherIndexType</code> into a certain integral type. \n</p><p>It is equivalent to:\n</p>\n<ul><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> i<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>, if <code>OtherIndexType</code> is an integral type other than <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span></span> and\n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"kw1\">static_cast</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>index_type<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>i<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code> otherwise.\n</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> i\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the index to be cast\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Cast index.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>A call to this function will always return an integral type other than <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span></span>. <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/is-integer-like#Integer-class_type\">Integer-class types</a> can use the <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">static_cast</span></span> branch without loss of precision because this function's call sites are already constrained on the convertibility of <code>OtherIndexType</code> to <code>index_type</code>.\n</p>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/mdspan","title":"std::mdspan"},{"path":"container/mdspan/extents","title":"std::extents, std::dextents, std::dims"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::extents<IndexType,Extents...>::index-cast","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++23. Casts the index i of type OtherIndexType into a certain integral type."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"i"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Cast index."},{"label":"Notes","note":"A call to this function will always return an integral type other than bool."}]},"standards":["C++23"],"wordCount":99,"codeBlockCount":0}
